UID:bear-chase-trail-run-2026@milehighrunners.com
DTSTAMP:20260823T000000Z
DTSTART:20261002T060000Z
DTEND:20261002T100000Z
SUMMARY:Bear Chase Trail Run
DESCRIPTION:An endurance festival at Bear Creek Lake Park offering distances from 5K to 100K. The non-technical dirt trails and moderate hills make it a perfect race for first-time ultra-runners.
LOCATION:15600 W Morrison Rd\, Lakewood\, CO 80465
STATUS:CONFIRMED
