DTSTAMP:20260823T000000Z
DTSTART:20261003T080000Z
DTEND:20261003T120000Z
SUMMARY:Rim to Rim Royal Gorge Races
DESCRIPTION:Scenic races including a 5K road run\, an 8-mile trail run\, and a half marathon trail run through the foothills and across the majestic Royal Gorge Bridge. The event also features a free 'Dinosaur Dash' kids race and virtual options.
LOCATION:Royal Gorge Bridge\, Canon City\, CO
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:the-bear-chase-2026@milehighrunners.com
DTSTAMP:20260823T000000Z
DTSTART:20261003T053000Z
DTEND:20261003T093000Z
SUMMARY:The Bear Chase
DESCRIPTION:The Bear Chase Race Endurance Festival features 100K\, 50 Mile\, 50K\, Half Marathon\, 10K and 5K trail races at Bear Creek Lake Park in Lakewood\, CO. The course is fast by trail/ultra standards with not overly technical terrain and sweeping panoramic views. 99% of the course is on soft surface and single track dirt trail.
LOCATION:15600 W. Morrison Road\, Lakewood\, CO
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
