UID:colorado-springs-marathon-2026@milehighrunners.com
DTSTAMP:20260823T000000Z
DTSTART:20261003T070000Z
DTEND:20261003T110000Z
SUMMARY:Colorado Springs Marathon
DESCRIPTION:A premier road race through the heart of Colorado Springs\, passing America the Beautiful Park and the Olympic & Paralympic Museum. The course is a mix of urban streets and city park trails.
LOCATION:E Pikes Peak Ave & S Tejon St\, Colorado Springs\, CO 80903
STATUS:CONFIRMED
