UID:windsor-marathon-2026@milehighrunners.com
DTSTAMP:20260823T000000Z
DTSTART:20261004T070000Z
DTEND:20261004T110000Z
SUMMARY:Windsor Marathon
DESCRIPTION:The Windsor Marathon events presented by Banner MD Anderson feature multiple distances for all abilities: 1 Mile Fit & Fun Run\, 5K\, 10K\, Half Marathon\, and Full Marathon. Starting and ending at The Island at Pelican Lakes in Water Valley with an after party including food\, drinks\, music\, and kids zone. Brought to you by run.Windsor Race Series and miles.Beyond. Race perks include finisher lunch\, beverages\, finisher shirts and medals\, and support for local nonprofits including Banner MD Anderson Cancer Center and Weld RE-4 Foundation.
LOCATION:The Island at Pelican Lakes in Water Valley\, Windsor\, CO 80550
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
