DTSTAMP:20260823T000000Z
DTSTART:20261114T090000Z
DTEND:20261114T130000Z
SUMMARY:Longmont Turkey Trot
DESCRIPTION:A scenic 10K and 2-mile race/walk. Features a wheelchair division for the 10K race. Participants can run\, roll\, or walk past the finish line to kick off the holiday season.
LOCATION:Altona Middle School\, Longmont\, CO
STATUS:CONFIRMED
