DTSTAMP:20260823T000000Z
DTSTART:20261121T083000Z
DTEND:20261121T123000Z
SUMMARY:Turkey Trek
DESCRIPTION:Turkey Trek features multiple distance options (2K\, 5K\, 10K\, and Half Marathon) with holiday-themed challenges including an Egg Nog Chug Challenge at the 3-mile summit\, a Hay Bale Hop Challenge\, and a Fill Your Pie Hole Challenge with pumpkin pie. The course includes an uphill climb to a mesa ridge with scenic views\, followed by a descent and flat sections. Half Marathon finishers receive a commemorative mug. All participants receive a performance blend brown hooded sweatshirt. Proceeds benefit Community Table food bank.
LOCATION:Long Lake Regional Park\, Arvada\, CO 80007
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
