SUMMARY:Broomfield Turkey Day 5K/10K
DESCRIPTION:Colorado's Only Thanksgiving Day 10K event welcoming all runners\, walkers\, and families. Features 5K and 10K races plus an untimed kids fun run (approx 1/2 mile). Includes finisher medals\, free pumpkin pie\, winter knit beanie swag\, chip timing\, and free parking. Benefits Broomfield FISH charity with food drive raffle.
