SUMMARY:Sawmill Trail Runs
DESCRIPTION:9th Annual Sawmill Trail Runs featuring 50K\, 16-Mile\, and 8-Mile distance options at Staunton State Park. Time limits: 12 hours (50K) and 11 hours (8 & 16 Mile). Capacity: 250 runners combined. Registration opens October 1\, 2026. Historic trail race first started in 2013\, officially incorporated in 2017\, moved to Staunton State Park in 2021.
LOCATION:12102 S Elk Creek Rd\, Pine\, CO 80470
STATUS:CONFIRMED
